            <ArticleTitle>[Thrombosis of lower-limb deep veins: a present-day view on conservative treatment].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>185-191</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article contains a review of the literature data concerning different variants of conservative treatment of patients suffering from lower limb deep vein thrombosis. This is accompanied and followed by demonstrating the manner of alterations in the views on using various anticoagulants, as well as analysing the attitude towards the place of compression therapy in treatment of patients with lower limb deep vein thrombosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
